  "details": "VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.04.21.11.57_Public\nUdon Assembly:\nhttps://pastebin.com/LmHZ9Qaa\nThe code running here runs with no issue for players who are non-owner and non-master. But for the owner, when trying to run the pictured part of the graph, most data after the central block is invalid or null. The log messages given say \"null\" for the owner, but display the correct value for non-owners.\nI don't have clear reproduction steps for this, but..\n- the Block node in this circumstance received execution flow from three sources: OnDeserialization and two Custom Event nodes.\n- the Block node was nested below another Block node, and had more Block nodes nested under it",
